{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator Command is a <strong>gladiator management sim</strong> set in the brutal world of <strong>ancient Rome</strong>. As the master of a rising Ludus (Gladiator School), you recruit fighters, train their stats, manage staff, balance finances, equip gear, and prepare your roster for real-time arena combat where your planning decides everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and develop gladiators with distinct stats, traits, and skill progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch real-time battles driven by the builds you create.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire scouts and staff to improve recruitment and recovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and manage gladiators as your school grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb through prestige tiers and take on stronger arenas</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Legacy and Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a roster that evolves over seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter multi-round tournaments for higher rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your school with better staff, upgrades, and long-term strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue a rising legacy where smart decisions outlast individual fights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator Command is built for players who want deep management, meaningful choices, and the long-form satisfaction of growing power through discipline and design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845450?t=1774365527","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845450?t=1774365527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845450/66a6d89719761871d9486ab